  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Numbers",
    "delineation": "Chapter",
    "number": 35,
    "summary": "The Levites are to possess their own cities—Cities of refuge are established for those guilty of manslaughter—Murderers are to be executed by the revenger of blood.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "And the Lord spake unto Moses in the plains of Moab by Jordan near Jericho, saying,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 62,
            "end": 66
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 1,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:1",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Command the children of Israel, that they give unto the Levites of the inheritance of their possession cities to dwell in; and ye shall give also unto the Levites suburbs for the cities round about them.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 56,
            "end": 63,
            "text": "Num. 18:23 (1, 20–32); Josh. 21:1 (1–3)."
          },
          {
            "start": 163,
            "end": 170,
            "text": "IE open areas for fields and pasture (also vv. 3–7). Lev. 25:34 (32–34); Josh. 14:4; 2 Chr. 11:14; Ezek. 48:15 (15–17)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 141,
            "end": 145
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:2",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "And the cities shall they have to dwell in; and the suburbs of them shall be for their cattle, and for their goods, and for all their beasts.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 39,
            "text": "Deut. 18:6."
          },
          {
            "start": 109,
            "end": 114,
            "text": "HEB property, livestock, etc."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Deut. 18:6.",
            "prettyString": "Deuteronomy 18:6",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "deuteronomy",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 18,
                    "end": 18,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 6,
                        "end": 6
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:3",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "And the suburbs of the cities, which ye shall give unto the Levites, shall reach from the wall of the city and outward a thousand cubits round about.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 69,
            "end": 80
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:4",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "And ye shall measure from without the city on the east side two thousand cubits, and on the south side two thousand cubits, and on the west side two thousand cubits, and on the north side two thousand cubits; and the city shall be in the midst: this shall be to them the suburbs of the cities.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 26,
            "end": 33,
            "text": "HEB the outside of."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 222,
            "end": 230
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:5",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "And among the cities which ye shall give unto the Levites there shall be six cities for refuge, which ye shall appoint for the manslayer, that he may flee thither: and to them ye shall add forty and two cities.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 88,
            "end": 94,
            "text": "TG Refuge."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 58,
            "end": 72
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Refuge.",
