                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:7",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "And the cities which ye shall give shall be of the possession of the children of Israel: from them that have many ye shall give many; but from them that have few ye shall give few: every one shall give of his cities unto the Levites according to his inheritance which he inheriteth.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 43
          },
          {
            "start": 94,
            "end": 108
          },
          {
            "start": 143,
            "end": 157
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:8",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "And the Lord spake unto Moses, saying,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:9",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Speak unto the children of Israel, and say unto them, When ye be come over Jordan into the land of Canaan;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:10",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Then ye shall appoint you cities to be cities of refuge for you; that the slayer may flee thither, which killeth any person at unawares.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 124,
            "end": 135,
            "text": "OR unintentionally."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:11",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "And they shall be unto you cities for refuge from the avenger; that the manslayer die not, until he stand before the congregation in judgment.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 54,
            "end": 61,
            "text": "Josh. 20:5 (3–6)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:12",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "And of these cities which ye shall give six cities shall ye have for refuge.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:13",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "Ye shall give three cities on this side Jordan, and three cities shall ye give in the land of Canaan, which shall be cities of refuge.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 102,
            "end": 107
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:14",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "These six cities shall be a refuge, both for the children of Israel, and for the stranger, and for the sojourner among them: that every one that killeth any person unawares may flee thither.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 81,
            "end": 89,
            "text": "Num. 15:15 (15–16); Josh. 20:9."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 36,
            "end": 40
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:15",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "And if he smite him with an instrument of iron, so that he die, he is a murderer: the murderer shall surely be put to death.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 86,
            "end": 94,
            "text": "See JST Gen. 9:10–13 (Appendix). Deut. 19:11 (11–13); 2 Ne. 9:35."
          },
          {
            "start": 118,
            "end": 123,
            "text": "TG Capital Punishment."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 67,
            "end": 69
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Capital Punishment.",
            "prettyString": "TG Capital Punishment",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Capital Punishment",
                "entryId": "tg-capital-punishment",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:16",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "And if he smite him with throwing a stone, wherewith he may die, and he die, he is a murderer: the murderer shall surely be put to death.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 80,
            "end": 82
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:17",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "Or if he smite him with an hand weapon of wood, wherewith he may die, and he die, he is a murderer: the murderer shall surely be put to death.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 3,
            "end": 5
          },
          {
            "start": 85,
            "end": 87
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:18",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "The revenger of blood himself shall slay the murderer: when he meeteth him, he shall slay him.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 12,
            "text": "2 Sam. 14:11."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "2 Sam. 14:11.",
            "prettyString": "2 Samuel 14:11",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "2samuel",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 14,
                    "end": 14,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 11,
                        "end": 11
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:19",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "But if he thrust him of hatred, or hurl at him by laying of wait, that he die;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 10,
            "end": 16,
            "text": "OR stabs."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 35:20",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 35,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "Or in enmity smite him with his hand, that he die: he that smote him shall surely be put to death; for he is a murderer: the revenger of blood shall slay the murderer, when he meeteth him.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 65,
            "end": 68
          },
          {
            "start": 99,
            "end": 102
          },
          {
            "start": 106,
